							</div>
							<div style="float: right">
								<div class="wrap-tool d-flex">
									<a onclick="fontMinus();" href="javascript:void(0);" title="Giảm cỡ chữ" class="" data-toggle="tooltip">
                                                <span class="icon-tool">
                                                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="25" height="25" viewbox="0 0 28 28" fill="none">
